      "widgets_values": [
        "FLUX.1 [dev] cho card 6 GB - BAN VE TAY, KHONG DUOC DUNG DE BAN\n\n=== GIAY PHEP ===\nFLUX.1 [dev] la FLUX Non-Commercial. Ban sach in tu no la VI PHAM tru khi\nmua giay phep cua Black Forest Labs. Vi vay file nay CHI o dinh dang giao\ndien, khong noi vao studio/ - de khong lo chay ca cuon sach bang no.\n\n=== DOC KY CHO NAY: 6 GB LAM HONG PHEP THU ===\nMay 6 GB nen phai ep dev xuong Q3_K_S. Do la muc nen KHA MANH.\nMay dang chay schnell o Q4_K_S - tuc la NEN NHE HON.\n\n  So dev-Q3 voi schnell-Q4 KHONG phai la so dev voi schnell.\n  Neu dev-Q3 thua, chua chac dev kem - co the chi la Q3 lam hong.\n  Neu dev-Q3 thang, thi dev that su hon han (vi no thang du bi trói tay).\n\nChi ket luan duoc mot chieu. Nho dieu do khi nhin ket qua.\n\n=== THU NAY MOI HOP MAY 6 GB ===\nFLUX.2 [klein] 4B - giay phep APACHE 2.0, ban hang thoai mai.\nBan GGUF Q4 chi ~2.6 GB. Voi 6 GB thi no chay THOAI MAI, khong phai ep\nxuong Q3 nhu dev. Tuc la ong duoc dung model gan nhu nguyen ban, thay vi\nmot model to hon nhung bi bop meo.\nHuong dan: docs.comfy.org/tutorials/flux/flux-2-klein\n(No dung text encoder Mistral chu khong phai T5 nen bo node khac - lam theo\ntrang tren, toi khong doan cau hinh.)\n\n=== PHAI BAT --lowvram ===\nSua run_nvidia_gpu.bat trong thu muc ComfyUI_windows_portable, them --lowvram\nvao cuoi dong lenh. Khong bat thi tran VRAM, ComfyUI se bao het bo nho hoac\nchay cham kinh khung.\nCu 1 anh khoang 3-6 phut. Cham, nhung la de XEM CHAT LUONG chu khong phai\nde chay san xuat - ve 4-6 anh la du ket luan.\n\n=== VI SAO TEXT ENCODER DUOC PHEP TO HON UNET ===\nComfyUI nap LAN LUOT: nap T5 -> ma hoa prompt -> GO T5 RA -> nap UNET -> ve.\nHai thang khong bao gio nam trong VRAM cung luc. Nen T5 Q5 (3.4 GB) van on\ndu UNET da 5.2 GB. Dung cong hai so lai roi hoang.\n\n=== KHAC SCHNELL ===\n1. Co node FluxGuidance (mau cam). Schnell KHONG co. 3.5 la mac dinh.\n2. 24 buoc chu khong phai 4. Schnell duoc chung cat cho 4 buoc, dev thi\n   khong - chay 4 buoc ra be bet.\n3. VAN khong co o negative. Kien truc Flux chay CFG=1 nen negative bi bo\n   qua. Cai KHONG muon phai viet vao o positive.\n   Cho nay de nham vi ban SDXL vua roi co negative that.\n\n=== CAN TAI ===\nflux1-dev-Q3_K_S.gguf (~5.2 GB)  -> models/unet/\n   huggingface.co/city96/FLUX.1-dev-gguf\nt5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-Q5_K_M.gguf (~3.4 GB) -> models/clip/\n   huggingface.co/city96/t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-gguf\nclip_l.safetensors va ae.safetensors da co san tu schnell, dung lai duoc."
      ],
